  "description": "Test helpers for apps built on EasyReasy.Auth: a software WebAuthn authenticator for testing passkey and security-key endpoints against the real verifier, and an OAuth test client with an in-memory store for driving the OAuth 2.1 authorization server end to end. For test projects only: never reference it from production code",
