  "releaseNotes": "InMemoryOAuthServerStore implements IOAuthServerStore.DeleteExpiredAsync: it deletes requests, codes and refresh tokens at or past their ExpiresAt, then the clients registered before the cutoff that nothing left names, as the server's sweep asks. Requires EasyReasy.Auth 5.18.0. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/easy-reasy/blob/auth-testing-v1.2.0/EasyReasy.Auth.Testing/README.md",
